<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Entrar | Huplex</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        body {
            background: #07080F;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .login-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 960px;
            min-height: 560px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        }

        .login-left {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0C0D18 0%, #0f1230 100%);
            padding: 60px 48px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .login-left::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -100px; right: -100px;
            width: 400px; height: 400px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(61,114,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }

        .logo span { color: #3D72FF; }

        .login-tagline h2 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .login-tagline p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .login-modules {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .login-module-item {
            background: rgba(61,114,255,0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(61,114,255,0.12);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .login-module-item i {
            color: #3D72FF;
            font-size: 13px;
            width: 16px;
        }

        .login-module-item span {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .login-right {
            background: #0C0D18;
            padding: 60px 48px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .login-right h3 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .login-right p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .form-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }

        .form-label {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .form-control {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 7px;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 11px 14px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            width: 100%;
            transition: border-color 0.2s;
            outline: none;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: rgba(61,114,255,0.5);
            background: rgba(61,114,255,0.04);
        }

        .form-control::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }

        .btn-login {
            width: 100%;
            background: #3D72FF;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 7px;
            padding: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .btn-login:hover {
            background: #5585ff;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .alert-danger {
            background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25);
            color: #f87171;
            border-radius: 7px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .login-wrapper { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin: 20px; }
            .login-left { display: none; }
            .login-right { padding: 40px 28px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="login-wrapper">
    {# Lado esquerdo #}
    <div class="login-left">
        <div class="logo">Hup<span>lex</span></div>

        <div class="login-tagline">
            <h2>Plataforma completa<br>de Gestão de Pessoas</h2>
            <p>RH, talentos, maturidade e gestão integrados em uma única plataforma.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="login-modules">
            <div class="login-module-item"><i class="fas fa-users"></i><span>Módulo RH</span></div>
            <div class="login-module-item"><i class="fas fa-sitemap"></i><span>Gest. de Pessoas</span></div>
            <div class="login-module-item"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><span>Hub de Talentos</span></div>
            <div class="login-module-item"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i><span>Hub de Maturidade</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# Lado direito — formulário #}
    <div class="login-right">
        <h3>Bem-vindo de volta</h3>
        <p>Entre com suas credenciais para acessar a plataforma</p>

        {% if error %}
            <div class="alert-danger">
                <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle mr-1"></i>
                {{ error.messageKey|trans(error.messageData, 'security') }}
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_login') }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_token('authenticate') }}">

            <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label">E-mail</label>
                <input class="form-control" type="email" name="email"
                       value="{{ last_username }}" placeholder="seu@email.com"
                       autocomplete="email" autofocus required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label">Senha</label>
                <input class="form-control" type="password" name="password"
                       placeholder="••••••••" autocomplete="current-password" required>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px">
                <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);font-size:12px;cursor:pointer">
                    <input type="checkbox" name="_remember_me" style="accent-color:#3D72FF">
                    Lembrar-me
                </label>
                <a href="#" style="color:rgba(61,114,255,0.7);font-size:12px;text-decoration:none">Esqueci a senha</a>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn-login">Entrar na plataforma</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
